---
source: crates/claude-code-rs/src/ui/command_palette.rs
expression: "render_palette_snapshot(\"/mcp\", &cwd, 100, 12, &[])"
---
"┌ Commands ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐"
"│/mcp                 MCP server management (list, status, add, edit, remove, connect)             │"
"│/doctor             (diagnostics)  Aggregated diagnostics (install, auth, settings, MCP, terminal)│"
"│/help               (h, ?)  Show available commands and their descriptions                        │"
"│/ide                 Detect, select, or reconnect the IDE MCP bridge                              │"
"│/memory             (mem)  View and manage CLAUDE.md project instructions                         │"
"│                                                                                                  │"
"│Usage: /mcp <list|status|add|edit|remove|connect|disconnect|reconnect>                            │"
"│Example: /mcp add ctx7 --command=npx --arg=-y --arg=@upstash/context7-mcp                         │"
"│Edit: user: ~/.cc-rust/settings.json | project: ./.cc-rust/settings.json                          │"
"│      local: ./.cc-rust/settings.local.json                                                       │"
"└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
